            },
            {
             "k": "message",
             "v": "feat(mitm): add aksh backend scripts, replay, conform, and golden tooling\n\n- up-aksh.sh/down-aksh.sh: manage local aksh server on :9090\n- replay.sh: replay golden captures against a target backend via mitmdump --server-replay\n- conform.sh: end-to-end conformance test (replay + compare)\n- record-golden.sh: record official captures as golden baselines\n- record-all.sh: batch-record all scenarios for a backend\n- list-goldens.sh: list available golden captures\n- clean-cache.sh/clean-captures.sh: housekeeping scripts\n- Bump runner_version 2.317→2.329.0\n- Add pytest optional dependency in pyproject.toml"
            },
            {
             "k": "timestamp",
             "v": "2026-06-28T14:52:00-04:00"
            },
