             "v": "feat(mitm): add scenarios 04-request-ack, 05-multi-job, and test suite\n\n- 04-request-ack: runner receives a job and acknowledges it (session + message exchange)\n- 05-multi-job: two sequential jobs testing session reuse and multi-job behavior\n- tests/test_mitm.py: unit tests for normalize_path, short_label, load_flows,\n  redact_report, match_event, and render_report"
