            {
             "k": "message",
             "v": "feat(mitm): add aksh backend support and parameterized compare labels\n\n- record.sh: add aksh backend (--backend aksh) using up-aksh.sh flow\n- _run_scenario.py: add aksh submit_workflow via REST POST /api/v1/runs\n- _compare.py: support --left/--right labels for comparison reports\n- compare.sh: accept --left/--right backend flags (default official vs runner-server)"
            },
