             "v": "fix: address cubic review — P1 cookie redaction, P2 crate names, P2 doc fixes\n\nP1: Add cookie header to REDACT_HEADERS in capture.py (was leaking session/auth)\nP2: Fix crate names aksh-protocol→aksh-gha-protocol, aksh-parser→aksh-gha-parser\n     in architecture.md, fidelity-gap.md\nP2: Fix --preloop→--aksh CLI flag in conformance.md example\nP2: Rewrite live-capture-report flow table from raw capture data — fix canonical\n     path patterns (pools/{n}/agents/{n} not pools/{n}/{n}/agents), correct flow\n     numbering, add missing flows #21-24, update requirements table references\nP3: Fix crate name in runner-server.md (already clean)\nP3: Add flows #21-24 to captured protocol flow table"
